usage: niagara_help versions extract [-h] [--verify-only] [--force] [--no-index] [--fill-missing]
                                     version

positional arguments:
  version         Registered version id (or a unique prefix)

options:
  -h, --help      show this help message and exit
  --verify-only   Only run the sha256 fidelity check and write the manifest
  --force         delete existing raw+derived dirs before extracting
  --no-index      Extract without running rebuild-all
  --fill-missing  only write jar entries whose file is absent (never overwrites; allowed on the
                  repo root)
